*.bak-*

# Per-device identity (2026-09-29): device-identity.local, this box's own
# "you are DISP-N" note. Already covered by the *.local rule above — no
# extra entry needed. NEVER commit/push it: a repo-tracked file is the SAME
# content on every box's clone, so it can never correctly say "this machine
# is X" for all of them at once (that's what caused the DISP-2/DISP-3
# mislabel). See AGENTS.md's IDENTITY note and FLEET-IDENTITY.md for the
# fleet-wide, tracked convention instead.
